-- paperclip:migration-safety-ignore large-create-index-not-concurrently: Drizzle migrations run transactionally, so CONCURRENTLY is unavailable and this composite index atomically bounds the wake-loop guard's per-(agent, issue) hourly SELECT against the agent_wakeup_requests table at SPA-9280. Without it, the hourly guard does a sequential scan on a table that holds one row per attempted wakeup across every agent and issue.
CREATE INDEX "agent_wakeup_requests_company_agent_issue_created_idx" ON "agent_wakeup_requests" USING btree ("company_id","agent_id",("payload" ->> 'issueId'),"created_at");